  "releaseNotes": "TinyEvents.PostgreSql.EntityFrameworkCore 0.1.0-alpha.2\n\n      Added\n      - PostgreSQL EF Core outbox writer using caller-owned DbContext changes.\n      - PostgreSQL worker store with atomic lease-based claiming.\n      - EF Core model builder extension for the PostgreSQL outbox schema.\n      - Dependency injection registration for PostgreSQL EF Core publishing and worker processing.\n      - PostgreSQL runtime tests and sample application.\n\n      Notes\n      - Early alpha / active development.\n      - Consumers must be idempotent because delivery is at-least-once.",
